{"Title":"An Act relative to increased access to safe swimming","BillNumber":"H559","DocketNumber":"HD1573","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"O_R1","Name":"Orlando Ramos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/O_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:44:22.637"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"O_R1","Name":"Orlando Ramos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/O_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:44:22.6366667"},{"Id":"A_G0","Name":"Adam Gomez","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/A_G0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:44:22.98"},{"Id":"MMD1","Name":"Michelle M. DuBois","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MMD1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-13T14:43:54.19"},{"Id":"BLW1","Name":"Bud L. Williams","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BLW1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-22T04:58:37.9933333"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"A_G0","Name":"Adam Gomez","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/A_G0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T15:44:22.637"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H559/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Ramos of Springfield and Senator Gomez, a joint petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 559) of Orlando Ramos, Adam Gomez and Michelle M. DuBois for legislation to increase access to safe swimming.  Education.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1.  The Massachusetts School Building Authority, under the authority granted in Section 3 of Chapter 70B of the General Laws, shall amend the School Building Grant Program Regulations (963 CMR 2.0) to provide for reimbursement for the construction or renovation of a swimming pool at a school in a municipality with a population greater than 35,000 and less than 250,000, a median household income below the commonwealth’s average and a rate of educational attainment of a bachelor’s degree or above that is below the commonwealth’s average.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J14","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J14"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}